msgid "What to Prioritize First"
msgstr "優先的に見るべき対象"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/how-to/interop.md:210
#: f9e62de3bf4446c7a2dafd850dcf2a9c
msgid ""
"The following targets are especially important because they sit close to the"
" direct-I/O boundary or because they are high-value public entry points:"
msgstr "公開面で先に理解すると効果が大きいのは次です。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/how-to/interop.md:212
#: 725ddcbd35574e1991bb710d1d06caa7
msgid ""
"**ROOT**: `io_formats` keeps only EventTable direct I/O; ROOT object "
"conversion belongs here"
msgstr ""
"**ROOT**: `io_formats` では EventTable の直 I/O のみ扱い、ROOT object 変換は interop "
"側で説明する"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/how-to/interop.md:213
#: bb5c79c99f684a7e9a38445c6bcd1764
msgid ""
"**xarray / Field**: the main route for ScalarField / VectorField bridges"
msgstr "**xarray / Field**: ScalarField / VectorField の主要な機能"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/how-to/interop.md:214
#: 5dee279428d34c28beaae2a328012e29
msgid "**Zarr**: easy to confuse with direct I/O, so the boundary matters"
msgstr "**Zarr**: direct I/O と interop の境界が混同されやすい"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/how-to/interop.md:215
#: 3699aef488f24ef5994bd75e069da0db
msgid ""
"**NetCDF4**: needs a clean line between direct I/O and xarray-backed "
"workflows"
msgstr "**NetCDF4**: xarray 経由のワークフローとの境界整理が必要"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/how-to/interop.md:216
#: 45b0aa90962547b5b2d9d6b81d247750
msgid "**ObsPy**: common and easy-to-understand round-trip examples"
msgstr "**ObsPy**: 時系列・地震波形との往復が分かりやすい"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/how-to/interop.md:217
#: a87810b71da449b48cad4161b46cf58c
msgid "**pandas / polars / astropy**: frequent analysis entry points"
msgstr "**pandas / polars / astropy**: 解析ワークフローの入口として頻出"

